# Environment variables for the prototype.
#
# Convention: copy this file to `.env` and fill in values locally. `.env` and `.env.*`
# are gitignored; only this example is tracked. List every variable the code reads here,
# with a comment saying what it is for and whether it is safe to expose to the browser.
# Never put a real secret in this file.

# FIGMA_ACCESS_TOKEN: a Figma personal access token, used only by `connect --publish` to
# publish Code Connect mappings. Server-side only: never expose it to the browser.
# Uncommented by /component-catalog when it turns on Code Connect; delete this block if the
# project doesn't use Figma.
# FIGMA_ACCESS_TOKEN=
